<title>USA: Box Energy Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Box Energy Corp Q3 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.15   profit	 $0.09</p>
<p> Net loss		   3,138   profit	 1,918</p>
<p> Revs			15,823		   14,914</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,803		   20,803</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.20   profit	 $0.17</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,194   profit	 3,493</p>
<p> Revs			52,757		   41,984</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  20,807		   20,803</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Avg shrs include class A voting stock (3.25 million shares) and class B non-voting stock (17.6 million shares).</p>
<p>1996 periods include a $1.9 million in reorganization costs, as well as increased litigation expenses.</p>
